# Terminal emulator preference order for xdg-terminal-exec
# The first found and valid terminal will be used.
#
# This is what SUPER+RETURN (omarchy-launch-terminal) resolves through, so it is
# the source of truth for "my terminal" -- $TERMINAL in uwsm/default only covers
# things that read that env var. With no list at all, xdg-terminal-exec scans for
# TerminalEmulator desktop entries and lands on foot.
com.mitchellh.ghostty.desktop
Alacritty.desktop
